1
00:00:08,851 --> 00:00:13,392
Medoro mein medicines ka poora master Stock
screen par hai.

2
00:00:13,432 --> 00:00:18,828
Har medicine ke saath uska salt, schedule, kul
stock, agli expiry, MRP

3
00:00:18,868 --> 00:00:21,079
aur rack location dikhta hai.

4
00:00:21,838 --> 00:00:26,088
Medicine ko brand name, salt ya barcode se khoj
sakte hain.

5
00:00:26,128 --> 00:00:31,687
Jaise salt mein Paracetamol likhne par us salt
ki saari brands aa jaati hain.

6
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:34,936
Ab nayi medicine jodte hain.

7
00:00:34,976 --> 00:00:37,847
'Add medicine' par click kijiye.

8
00:00:37,887 --> 00:00:44,940
Naam, salt, MRP, GST rate, pack size, loose
unit, reorder level, rack, barcode

9
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:48,214
aur schedule, sab yahin bharte hain.

10
00:00:48,967 --> 00:00:53,289
MRP paintaalees rupaye prati strip, GST paanch
pratishat.

11
00:00:53,329 --> 00:00:57,422
Ek strip mein das tablets, aur loose bikri ki
anumati,

12
00:00:57,462 --> 00:01:01,554
taaki zaroorat padne par ek-do tablet bhi bech
sakein.

13
00:01:02,319 --> 00:01:07,883
Reorder level pandrah strips, rack A3, aur pack
par chhapa barcode.

14
00:01:07,923 --> 00:01:13,487
Yeh medicine Schedule H mein nahi hai, isliye
schedule None rahega.

15
00:01:13,527 --> 00:01:14,742
Ab Save kijiye.

16
00:01:15,518 --> 00:01:17,723
Nayi medicine list mein aa gayi.

17
00:01:17,763 --> 00:01:23,686
Abhi iska stock shoonya hai; batch aur expiry ke
saath stock purchase bill se aayega,

18
00:01:23,726 --> 00:01:26,492
jo hum Purchase wale part mein dekhenge.

19
00:01:27,235 --> 00:01:31,404
Kisi medicine ko edit karne ke liye pencil icon
dabaaiye.

20
00:01:31,444 --> 00:01:36,943
Maan lijiye Paracip 650 ki rack badalni hai aur
reorder level badhaana hai.

21
00:01:37,688 --> 00:01:41,392
Save karte hi badlaav har counter par pahunch
jaata hai.

22
00:01:41,432 --> 00:01:43,866
Aur agar koi medicine ab nahi bechni,

23
00:01:43,906 --> 00:01:49,951
to use delete karne ki bajaay 'In use' ka tick
hata dijiye; woh billing se chhip jaati hai,

24
00:01:49,991 --> 00:01:52,492
par uska purana record bana rehta hai.

25
00:01:53,262 --> 00:01:59,350
Batch wale icon se har batch ki expiry, bacha
stock aur status dikhta hai.

26
00:01:59,390 --> 00:02:04,070
HSN code, GST aur MRP har bill par apne-aap
chhapte hain.

27
00:02:10,127 --> 00:02:13,718
Inventory part mein hum stock sambhaalna
seekhenge.

28
00:02:13,758 --> 00:02:19,129
Stock screen par har medicine ka kul stock, agli
expiry aur rack dikhta hai.

29
00:02:19,169 --> 00:02:25,894
'Low stock only' tick karne par sirf woh
medicines dikhti hain jo reorder level se neeche
hain.

30
00:02:26,638 --> 00:02:29,704
Doosre billing software se aa rahe hain?

31
00:02:29,744 --> 00:02:33,587
Purani stock list Excel ya CSV mein Import
kijiye.

32
00:02:33,627 --> 00:02:37,935
Medoro pehle preview dikhata hai, har row mein
kya hoga,

33
00:02:37,975 --> 00:02:41,119
aur galti ho to kuch bhi save nahi karta.

34
00:02:41,887 --> 00:02:47,222
Yahan teen naye items hain, thermometer, mask
aur sanitizer, unke batch

35
00:02:47,262 --> 00:02:49,266
aur opening stock ke saath.

36
00:02:49,306 --> 00:02:52,142
Import dabaate hi stock jud jaata hai.

37
00:02:52,900 --> 00:02:54,829
Ab batches dekhte hain.

38
00:02:54,869 --> 00:02:59,881
Paracip 650 ke kai batches hain, alag-alag
expiry ke saath.

39
00:02:59,921 --> 00:03:05,617
Billing par Medoro FEFO niyam chalata hai: First
Expiry, First Out,

40
00:03:05,657 --> 00:03:10,583
yaani jo batch sabse pehle expire hoga, wahi
pehle bikega.

41
00:03:11,326 --> 00:03:16,901
Agar koi strip toot-phoot gayi, to 'Correct
stock' mein kaaran chunkar maatra ghataaiye.

42
00:03:16,941 --> 00:03:20,538
Har adjustment ka kaaran aur samay record mein
rehta hai.

43
00:03:21,278 --> 00:03:26,025
Stock count ke liye, shelf par gini hui maatra
Counted mein daaliye

44
00:03:26,065 --> 00:03:28,168
aur 'Save stock count' kijiye.

45
00:03:28,208 --> 00:03:30,597
Farq apne-aap adjust ho jaata hai.

46
00:03:31,357 --> 00:03:35,870
Branch transfer: Kanke Road branch mein ORS kam
pad gaya hai.

47
00:03:35,910 --> 00:03:40,349
Batch chunkar, branch aur maatra bhariye, aur
Send dabaaiye.

48
00:03:40,389 --> 00:03:44,828
Stock yahan se ghatkar doosri branch mein
pahunch jaata hai.

49
00:03:45,574 --> 00:03:51,063
Batch ka status bhi badal sakte hain: OK to
sell, Quarantine, ya Recalled.

50
00:03:51,103 --> 00:03:57,786
Quarantine ya Recalled batch billing mein nahi
bikta, jab tak aap use waapas OK na karein.

51
00:03:58,543 --> 00:04:02,569
Expiry par nazar rakhne ke liye sidebar mein
Expiry prevention

52
00:04:02,609 --> 00:04:06,831
aur Stock intelligence hain, jahan jaldi expire
hone wale batches

53
00:04:06,871 --> 00:04:08,930
aur reorder ki salaah milti hai.

54
00:04:08,970 --> 00:04:12,733
Reorder level har medicine ke edit form mein set
hota hai.
